{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7671295054066354478","title":"视觉算法工程师-人像","description":"1. 负责图像处理、深度学习、计算机视觉、模式识别等相关领域的算法研发；\n2. 负责移动端图像的智能图像效果研发，包括但不限于深度估计，降噪，超分，补全，分割，识别等；\n3. 结合AI技术完成手机端侧落地需求，跟踪AI领域前沿方向，实现探索创新；\n4. 基于最新的AIGC技术包括不限于GAN、Diffusion，完成图像/视频编辑、文生图、图生图、图像补全生成等任务研发，并解决可控性、可编辑、保真性、定制化等核心问题。","requirement":"1. 计算机相关专业硕士及以上学历，熟练掌握C/C++、python编程语言；\n2. 熟练掌握一种或几种深度学习框架（Tensorflow /Pytorch/MXNet等），熟练掌握transformer、Diffusers等大模型库使用，具有较强的算法实现能力；\n3. 熟练掌握diffusion相关的各种采样、编码、迭代等基本知识，熟练掌握styleGan、Stable diffusion 系列论文方法，并完整训练且微调过相关大模型；\n4. 有大模型端侧部署落地经验优先；\n5. 在领域内顶会/顶刊有论文发表者，在各类视觉竞赛、算法竞赛中获得较高名次，在GitHub较大影响力开源项目有贡献者优先考虑。","city_info":{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","i18n_name":"上海"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786112714077,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7467761476330340460","name":"算法类","en_name":"Algorithm","i18n_name":"算法类"},"job_id":"7671295054066223406","city_list":[{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"ci